#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ADULT_FLYTRAP.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ADULT_FLYTRAP.DEAD"
