#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_ACTIVE"
