msgstr "Amo, lenza e canna!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHINHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHINHOLE"
