msgstr "La scienza lo fa risplendere."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_TRIPLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_TRIPLE"
