msgstr "Potrebbe infilzarmi come uno spiedino!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BILL.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BILL.SLEEPING"
