msgstr "L'arma del codardo. Mi si addice!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP"
