msgstr "Per vedere cosa si avvicina!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_TORCH"
