msgstr "Attenzione a quelle spine!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BRAMBLE_BULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BRAMBLE_BULB"
