msgstr "Per catturare le proteine alternative."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUGREPELLENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUGREPELLENT"
