msgstr "Un bell'esemplare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BURR_SAPLING.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BURR_SAPLING.PICKED"
