msgstr "È già stato raccolto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BURR_SAPLING.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BURR_SAPLING.WITHERED"
