msgstr "Spuntini da viaggio?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNT"
