msgstr "Posso farne formaggio?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESARMORHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESARMORHAT"
