msgstr "Credo che dica \"accendi i fornelli\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_PALACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_PALACE"
