#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_NO_SMOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.DECO_WALLORNAMENT_NO_SMOKING"
