msgstr "Ops!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYFEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYFEATHER"
