msgstr "Irradia un calore opprimente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONHEART"
