msgstr "Il cuore porta solo dolore in ogni caso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONSPIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONSPIT"
