msgstr "Ahah! Divertente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TROPICALBOUILLABAISSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TROPICALBOUILLABAISSE"
