msgstr "Che tempo fa, signor misuratore termico?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSBOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSBOAT"
