msgstr "Che cosa aprirà?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2"
