msgstr "Mmmmm. Bacche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_SNAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_SNAKE"
