#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_DOUBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_DOUBLE"
