#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_TRIPLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_TRIPLE"
