msgstr "Che spreco di legna buona."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.GENERIC"
